. 3 tablespoons of butter, about 40 cents. A cup of milk, a quarter. Salt and pepper, a nickel. That's about $3.30 for a pot that feeds 6, 55 cents a bowl. A can of soup at the store is more than that for one bowl, and half of it is water and salt. A bowl at a restaurant, eight or nine dollars.", "words": [{"w": " And", "s": 0.0, "e": 0.16}, {"w": " one", "s": 0.16, "e": 0.36}, {"w": " more", "s": 0.36, "e": 0.66}, {"w": " thing", "s": 0.66, "e": 1.02}, {"w": " people", "s": 1.02, "e": 1.38}, {"w": " ask", "s": 1.38, "e": 1.78}, {"w": " me,", "s": 1.78, "e": 2.28}, {"w": " can", "s": 2.28, "e": 2.36}, {"w": " you", "s": 2.36, "e": 2.56}, {"w": " make", "s": 2.56, "e": 2.86}, {"w": " it", "s": 2.86, "e": 3.04}, {"w": " ahead?", "s": 3.04, "e": 3.84}, {"w": " Yes,", "s": 3.92, "e": 4.56}, {"w": " make", "s": 4.56, "e": 4.8}, {"w": " the", "s": 4.8, "e": 4.96}, {"w": " soup", "s": 4.96, "e": 5.28}, {"w": " up", "s": 5.28, "e": 5.5}, {"w": " to", "s": 5.5, "e": 5.62}, {"w": " the", "s": 5.62, "e": 5.76}, {"w": " point", "s": 5.76, "e": 6.08}, {"w": " before", "s": 6.08, "e": 6.42}, {"w": " the", "s": 6.42, "e": 6.64}, {"w": " milk", "s": 6.64, "e": 6.98}, {"w": " and", "s": 6.98, "e": 7.38}, {"w": " keep", "s": 7.38, "e": 7.66}, {"w": " it", "s": 7.66, "e": 7.86}, {"w": " in", "s": 7.86, "e": 8.0}, {"w": " the", "s": 8.0, "e": 8.12}, {"w": " refrigerator.", "s": 8.12, "e": 9.2}, {"w": " When", "s": 9.28, "e": 9.42}, {"w": " it's", "s": 9.42, "e": 9.58}, {"w": " time", "s": 9.58, "e": 9.92}, {"w": " for", "s": 9.92, "e": 10.1}, {"w": " supper,", "s": 10.1, "e": 10.98}, {"w": " warm", "s": 10.98, "e": 11.1}, {"w": " it", "s": 11.1, "e": 11.26}, {"w": " gently,", "s": 11.26, "e": 12.12}, {"w": " stir", "s": 12.12, "e": 12.28}, {"w": " in", "s": 12.28, "e": 12.5}, {"w": " the", "s": 12.5, "e": 12.62}, {"w": " milk,", "s": 12.62, "e": 13.26}, {"w": " and", "s": 13.26, "e": 13.36}, {"w": " it's", "s": 13.36, "e": 13.54}, {"w": " ready", "s": 13.54, "e": 13.84}, {"w": " in", "